{"id":"383d2d73b5989dd40c86139dd18f648d1377ca12","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/academic/FpJFXrs9xGOOewKA.html","title":"中大梁小丹团队，GeoThinker 两项研究成果，破除空间推理「几何信息用不好、计算开销大」难题 | 雷峰网","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"不再实时调用外部三维几何编码器，视觉语言模型空间推理提速约 3.6 倍。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"中大梁小丹团队，GeoThinker 两项研究成果，破除空间推理「几何信息用不好、计算开销大」难题\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafOGiaz0HfiadDJG9Pcf72kcQxrdM8pJeeyOq9u098skecWJeePr7fObkPp0bmugmzATG5Ml6DmUgpHmxIv5JfMn8gUw891yB27ac/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"307\" data-imgfileid=\"100265096\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261113/6af6be4aae4b1.jpg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1000\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261113/6af6be4aae4b1.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">不再实时调用外部三维几何编码器，视觉语言模型空间推理提速约 3.6 倍。</span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mqgbkegzw9n\"></span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mpmlbwxl8oz\"></span><span da